--- !u!114 &360120186
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 360120181}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e29f81c3716d48c4e85e9381a4f9bf3c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Dialogue:
    defaultDialogueLines:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: That's just rude man. What the hell?!
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: You wanna be a gunslinger? Yeah well good luck with that.
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: First of all a gunslinger needs a gun. Something you clearly don't have.
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: You dug my grave to find one? Hah! You must be real stupid if you think
        I would hide something so precious in such an obvious place.
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: '[The ghost scans you up and down]'
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: Ah blast it, I'm dead anyways... If you truly want my gun, then it's
        in a chest, that you can find buried near that old dried out well.
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: As for the key... Well my lover has it, might as well desecrate her grave
        as well, since you are in such a graverobbing mood.
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: I warn you though, if you take my gun, you have to prove you are good
        enough to use it.
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: I don't know, shoot like 4 bottles, and I won't haunt you and kill you
        in your sleep or something...
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3746d3b307c327f4584b7ed685348227, type: 2}
      text: Good luck pal.
    afterDialogueEvent:
